<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 215,983.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 215,983.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of April 1 totaled 215,983 bales, up from 214,071 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,912 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 6,059 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
